<title>UK: Telspec appoints Paget as chief executive.</title>
<headline>Telspec appoints Paget as chief executive.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>British telecommunications equipment group Telspec said on Friday that it had appointed Jonathan Paget as chief executive of the company with effect from January 1, 1997.</p>
<p>Paget, 50, is currently the vice president and general manager of Motorola Corp's European Radio Network Solutions Group.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
